{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789582824083,"sessionID":"ses_f548d4601ffexVe8EB5C0dFyGc","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_501da6fcbc3f4d0ca25c7ec0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/tmp/opencode/phase2/P2-T8-ON-2/work/spec.md"},"output":"<path>/tmp/opencode/phase2/P2-T8-ON-2/work/spec.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Fare formula change (fixture crate `fleet`)\n2: \n3: The fare formula changes from per-km-only to base-plus-per-km. Standard library only.\n4: \n5: ## New formula\n6: \n7: - Fare for a `km`-kilometre trip: `5 + 3 * km`.\n8: - Applies to all FARE commands. Staff meal pricing is unrelated and must not change.\n9: \n10: ## Layout\n11: \n12: ```text\n13: src/lib.rs        command registry + `pub use pricing::price` re-export\n14: src/pricing.rs    fare pricing: `pub fn price(km: u32) -> u32`\n15: src/staff.rs      staff canteen meal pricing: `pub fn price(km: u32) -> u32` (independent)\n16: src/handlers.rs   command handlers wired into the registry\n17: ```\n18: \n19: - Registry (`inventory()`): `\"standard\"` → standard handler, `\"express\"` → express\n20:   handler, `\"staff\"` → staff-meal handler.\n21: - The express handler resolves pricing through the crate-root re-export\n22:   (`crate::price`), not through a direct module path.\n23: - Expected behaviors after the change: standard(10 km) → `\"fare 35\"`,\n24:   express(20 km) → `\"fare 65\"`, staff meal(5) → `\"meal 10\"`.\n\n(End of file - total 24 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Fare formula change (fixture crate `fleet`)\n\nThe fare formula changes from per-km-only to base-plus-per-km. Standard library only.\n\n## New formula\n\n- Fare for a `km`-kilometre trip: `5 + 3 * km`.\n- Applies to all FARE commands. Staff meal pricing is unrelated and must not change.\n\n## Layout\n\n```text\nsrc/lib.rs        command registry + `pub use pricing::price` re-export\nsrc/pricing.rs    fare pricing: `pub fn price(km: u32) -> u32`\nsrc/staff.rs      staff canteen meal pricing: `pub fn price(km: u32) -> u32` (independent)\nsrc/handlers.rs   command handlers wired into the registry\n```\n\n- Registry (`inventory()`): `\"standard\"` → standard handler, `\"express\"` → express\n  handler, `\"staff\"` → staff-meal handler.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/tmp/opencode/phase2/P2-T8-ON-2/work/spec.md","text":"# Fare formula change (fixture crate `fleet`)\n\nThe fare formula changes from per-km-only to base-plus-per-km. Standard library only.\n\n## New formula\n\n- Fare for a `km`-kilometre trip: `5 + 3 * km`.\n- Applies to all FARE commands. Staff meal pricing is unrelated and must not change.\n\n## Layout\n\n```text\nsrc/lib.rs        command registry + `pub use pricing::price` re-export\nsrc/pricing.rs    fare pricing: `pub fn price(km: u32) -> u32`\nsrc/staff.rs      staff canteen meal pricing: `pub fn price(km: u32) -> u32` (independent)\nsrc/handlers.rs   command handlers wired into the registry\n```\n\n- Registry (`inventory()`): `\"standard\"` → standard handler, `\"express\"` → express\n  handler, `\"staff\"` → staff-meal handler.\n- The express handler resolves pricing through the crate-root re-export\n  (`crate::price`), not through a direct module path.\n- Expected behaviors after the change: standard(10 km) → `\"fare 35\"`,\n  express(20 km) → `\"fare 65\"`, staff meal(5) → `\"meal 10\"`.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":24,"totalLines":24,"truncated":false}},"title":"tmp/opencode/phase2/P2-T8-ON-2/work/spec.md","time":{"start":1789582824071,"end":1789582824081}},"id":"prt_0ab72d234001ScUg6XFhSZZ0M0","sessionID":"ses_f548d4601ffexVe8EB5C0dFyGc","messageID":"msg_0ab72bb7d001b3pP1B22NqqTbe"}}
